Name: ori_term|ori_term terminal emulator                                       
\r ^M (cr)    = ^M                                                              
\n ^J (ind)   = ^J                                                              
\b ^H (cub1)  = ^H                                                              
\t ^I (ht)    = ^I                                                              
      (nel)   = ^[E                                                             
      (clear) = ^[[H^[[2J                                                       
      (home)  = ^[[H                                                            
ENQ   (u9)    = ^[[c                                                            
ACK   (u8)    = ^[[?%[;0123456789]c                                             
                                                                                
Terminal size: 80 x 24.  Baud rate: 38400.  Frame size: 10.0                    
                                                                                
Main Menu                                                                       
 b) display basic information                                                   
 m) change modes                                                                
 t) tools                                                                       
 n) begin testing                                                               
 l) start logging                                                               
 q) quit                                                                        
 ?) help                                                                        
                                                                                
tack [n] >
